--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ local constexpr array element in if constexpr: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ in a template: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ the other branch: SUCCESS$
